  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DebugLogText
  text: Here the camera should show the view of the whole garage (from the tables
    on the left to the shelving unit on the right). IT's the moment hte player notices
    that the door is closed so if the camera could go around the room and zoom to
    the door, that would be nice. It should finish the overview on the broken TICA
    to catch the player's attention.
